  "fullText": "Now offering an off-site tuning session at cost to three selected teams in 2026. Apply Here\n\nSkip to Content\nOpen Menu\nBehind every metric are the humans driving it.\nHow We Work with Investors\n\nWe partner with funds to strengthen the human systems that power your portfolio—starting with the people who lead them.\n\nBlending the depth of coaching with the precision of culture consulting, we make the “people variable” in startups more predictable, more resilient, and far less risky.\n\nWe Help You See Clearly\n\nRelational dynamics are one of the top reasons startups stall or fail—and they’re often invisible until it’s too late.\n\nWe help you catch early signals of misalignment, burnout, or team breakdown, then work with founders and leaders to address them before they impact performance or valuation.\n\nThe strongest funds invest in founders and in how they grow.\n\nOur Difference\n\n“The Heartwood Collective team is one of the few coaching groups that truly understands venture because they were born inside a VC firm. They’re pioneering a model of firm-level and portfolio-level coaching that can drive tangible outcomes.“\n\nMiles Bird \n\nGP, Storyhouse Ventures\n\nSERVICES\n\nWe offer founder and company support from diligence to exit.\n\nPeople Diligence\nPortfolio Core\nCoaching for Founders and Companies\nTHE HEALTH\nOF YOUR PORTFOLIO\nSTARTS HERE\n\nLET’S GET STARTED\n\nBook a Call\nCORE TEAM\n\nOur coaches are bilingual in transformation and business.\n\n Our team combines deep expertise in leadership development and systems change with firsthand experience inside the venture and startup world.\n\nWe’re not just coaches—we’re strategic partners who understand what’s at stake.\n\nTrusted by founders, operators, and investors alike, we bring rigor, discernment, and a clear read on what actually moves companies and portfolios forward.\n\nMeet the Team\nTogetherness that works\n\nWe facilitate the growth of individuals and groups to create high-functioning teams.\n\nGet Started\nNewsletter + Podcast\n\nWomens Retreat\n\nStories, insights, and new ideas from Heartwood. Get our monthly Newsletter, new podcast episodes and more by subsribing to Heartwood Collective on Substack. \n\nEvents\n\nVC Retreat\n\nFollow\n\nLinkedIn\n\nGet in touch\n\nhello@thehwc.com\n\nSubstack\n\nYoutube\n\nSelf-Transforming Teams\n\nHome\n\nThe Team\n\nFor Companies\n\nFor Investors\n\nTO TOP\n\nWe Respect your Privacy - Privacy Policy  | Data Processing Policy\n2025 Heartwood Collective, a part of Project Atlas LLC.\nCookie Preferences"
